  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n12.999 - 3.998 + 14.002 × 3.998 + 27.008 ÷ 3.001 + 35.999 ÷ 5.998 = ?\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5318b7214511d5250561643c29d457595d0c86582942de2d039b089d742d0c8e.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 12.999 - 3.998 + 14.002 × 3.998 + 27.008 ÷ 3.001 + 35.999 ÷ 5.998 = ?\n\n⇒ 13 - 4 + 14 × 4 + 27 ÷ 3 + 36 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 9 + 56 + 9 + 6\n\n⇒ 80\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
